flowchart TD
    %% add_domain
    add[add_domain path] --> exists{Folder exists?}
    exists -->|no| err[Refuse]
    exists -->|yes| manifest{MANIFEST.md at the root?}
    manifest -->|no| err
    manifest -->|yes| keys[Read configuration keys]
    keys --> registry{Every key in policy_registry?}
    registry -->|no| warn[Report the unknown key]
    registry -->|yes| register[Register the domain]
    warn --> register
    register --> first[First full sync]
